  "description": "The Horizon SUV 20 Wave features a low step-through design for easy mounting and everyday convenience. LED lighting boosts visibility, and the Racktime carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility allows quick setup for touring trips or family transport – with trailer capability for added versatility.\n\nThe adjustable stem allows for a relaxed riding position, SP Connect enables simple smartphone mounting, and the dropper seat post makes starting, stopping and mounting easier. Wide trekking tires ensure confident grip and a smooth ride on trails and uneven paths, complemented by full fenders for all-weather protection. A 120mm suspension fork softens rough patches, and the 10-speed drivetrain provides reliable shifting on varied terrain.\n\nPowered by the Bosch Performance Line CX motor and a removable 720Wh PowerTube battery, it offers strong, efficient assistance. The model is also compatible with a PowerMore range extender, while with the Bosch eBike Flow App, you can check your bike's data, find advanced connectivity features and any available upgrades.",
